  "description": "Clash / mihomo（Clash Meta）代理组自动测速与自愈：直连 ChatGPT、Codex 等目标站点判定节点的真实可用性，节点挂了自动换可用节点，并装好定时任务自动巡检；支持 macOS / Linux / Windows。Auto-fix and self-heal Clash / mihomo proxy groups by probing real endpoint reachability.",
